{"id":786512,"title":"06｜GPTs智能体案例解析：小红书文案、流程图设计与编辑","content":"对于不懂技术或编程的用户，推荐使用语句AI或GPTS来构建智能体。语句AI操作简单，而GPTS则适合对电脑有一定了解但不擅长编程的人。无论是哪种工具，其核心都依赖于大模型作为“大脑”。现成平台如语句AI和GPTS绑定了特定的大模型，用户只能在其生态内操作；而开源框架如AutoGen.MateGPT则允许用户选择不同的商用或开源模型。课程中通过分析小红书爆款村家案例，展示了如何设计一个AR Agent培训方案的智能体：首先定义角色为文案写作专家，然后设定步骤包括搜索、总结、拆分标题及填充内容。另一个示例是流程图设计智能体，它不仅生成电商购物流程图，还支持编辑与调整，甚至可以调度外部工具如Mermaid语法渲染图像，体现了智能体结合大模型与外部工具实现灵活定制的能力。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":392038,"user_name":"一鸣","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2573931,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"A01D44A9A951F4","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/27/46/6b/6c26c731.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1719805164,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":142633,"content":"哈哈是的。它本身也想发展成一个智能体平台。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1719027,"ctime":1720787637,"ip_address":"山东","comment_id":392038,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":2,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_content":"语聚AI中也支持选择模型了。","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1719027,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1a/3a/f3/106ff941.jpg","nickname":"周文洋","note":"","ucode":"61D85493E804D1","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":647935,"discussion_content":"哈哈是的。它本身也想发展成一个智能体平台。","content_length":21,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1720787637,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"山东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":2573931,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/27/46/6b/6c26c731.jpg","nickname":"一鸣","note":"","ucode":"A01D44A9A951F4","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","